  "sections": [
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "title": "Fear their healer, then go",
      "body": "All 6 of our goes that led to a kill had Psychic Scream on their healer; 6 of the other 10 did. The DK and Monk usually burst together; it killed when their healer was locked out or kicked during those 6 seconds. We killed a Ret twice, an Elemental and an Unholy DK. Touch of Death finished 2 of the 4. Seven games is a start: a proposal to correct."
    },
    {
      "kind": "sequence",
      "title": "Main go: crowd control on their healer, on top of the burst",
      "steps": [
        {
          "spec": "priest/discipline",
          "spell": "Psychic Scream",
          "note": "On their healer during the burst. Locked or kicked then: 3 of 5 killed; free: 1 of 7."
        },
        {
          "spec": "deathknight/unholy",
          "spell": "Asphyxiate",
          "note": "Onto their healer as the fear ends. The 20:19 kill: healer stunned as the DK died."
        },
        {
          "spec": "deathknight/unholy",
          "spell": "Mind Freeze",
          "note": "Or kick their healer inside the burst: 2 of the 6 goes that killed."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "sequence",
      "title": "Main go: offensive cooldowns",
      "steps": [
        {
          "spec": "deathknight/unholy",
          "spell": "Army of the Dead",
          "note": "With Dark Transformation: the DK's half of every kill."
        },
        {
          "spec": "deathknight/unholy",
          "spell": "Dark Transformation",
          "note": "Pressed in all 6 goes that killed."
        },
        {
          "spec": "monk/windwalker",
          "spell": "Zenith",
          "note": "The Monk's half. In all 6 goes that killed."
        },
        {
          "spec": "monk/windwalker",
          "spell": "Touch of Death",
          "note": "The finish at 3-9% health. 2 of the 4 kills."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "defensives",
      "title": "Hold the trinket for their kill, and do not stack on the DK",
      "steps": [
        {
          "spec": "priest/discipline",
          "spell": "Gladiator's Medallion",
          "note": "For the CC that comes with their cooldowns. Already used in 2 of 3 losses."
        },
        {
          "spec": "priest/discipline",
          "spell": "Pain Suppression",
          "note": "Not on top of Icebound or Lichborne: stacked 5 times in 3 losses, 3 in 4 wins."
        },
        {
          "spec": "deathknight/unholy",
          "spell": "Icebound Fortitude",
          "note": "The DK's own big one. Pain Suppression on top of it was the usual overlap."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "title": "What beat us: answers on time, CC on our Priest at the kill",
      "body": "In the 3 losses the enemy spent more defensives per go than the teams we beat (4.6 against 3.2), and none of our goes led to a kill. Every kill on us came with our Priest locked out: Garrote, Strangulate, Silence. We lost to Resto Druid/Affliction/Assassination, Resto Druid/Unholy/BM (1-1 in a rematch) and Resto Shaman/Shadow Priest/Affliction."
    }
  ]
